Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 03:48:45 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Add gfx1013 to rocBLAS and Tensile (ROCm/rocm-libraries#8838,
 without tests)


ROCm/rocm-libraries#8838 by Matt Thompson (boondocklabs) and Estevan
Vedovelli (AMD), still open on 2026-11-14. Taken as-is minus its
Tensile test YAMLs and pytest.ini. Drop this patch once the PR is in the
rocm-libraries commit TheRock pins.
